width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/unique/scepter.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"118\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:62/118\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Knell \nStriker</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Scepter</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>One-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(11.9-12.6) To (20.4-21.6)</font> (16.15-17.1 Avg)<br>Required \nLevel: 5<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Durability: 50<br>Base Weapon Speed: \n[0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+70-80% Enhanced Damage</font> (varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To Undead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">25% Chance Of \nCrushing Blow</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+35 To Attack \nRating</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Poison Resist +20%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Fire Resist +20%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+15 To \nMana</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>한손 \n                            데미지: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(11.9-12.6) To (20.4-21.6)</font> (16.15-17.1 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 \n                            : 5<br>힘 요구치 : 25<br>내구력 : 50<br>무기기본속도 \n                            : \n[0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+70-80% 증가된 데미지  </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% 언데드계열에대한 데미지</font